2.45.2

Add BTMTK_WMT_PKT_* enum to represent WMT download packet sequence flags,
improving code readability. Replace magic numbers (1, 2, 3) in
btmtk_setup_firmware_79xx() and btmtk_setup_firmware() with descriptive
